  "findings": [
    "The executor differs from the accepted V36 baseline only in its descriptive version literal, frozen Main basis, and exact one-phase manifest tuple. All release/pin, preimage, scope, attribute, stage, raw index/commit and clean-state gates remain byte-exact in the complete execution tail.",
