    "All 138 historical list prefixes and every unrelated top-level field remain exact. Removing the one new top-level record and restoring the nine declared current fields reproduces the full original 438396-byte progress. The full old checkpoint is appended, and the three V37 outcomes remain distinct with all five original failing indices and the nonempty runtime stderr retained.",
    "The new current-root list matches Main while the original historical root list and complete 4+63 group order remain unchanged. Future metadata, runtime acceptance, application qualification and new execution authority remain unresolved or false."
  ],
